# The runtime image only needs scripts and the mr_pkg ROS source tree.
# Keep Unity assets, player builds, experiment data and caches out of the context.
**
!Docker/
!Docker/Dockerfile
!Docker/Scripts/
!Docker/Scripts/**
!Scripts/
!Scripts/host_ros2_env.bash
!Scripts/plot_experiment_metrics.py
!Scripts/ub_experiment/
!Scripts/ub_experiment/**
!submodules/
!submodules/mr_pkg/
!submodules/mr_pkg/**
**/.git
**/__pycache__
submodules/mr_pkg/build
submodules/mr_pkg/install
submodules/mr_pkg/log
